Z||000003||Philphine||12-29-2000||01:21 AM||||i asked a similar question a while back when i noticed a slight difference in intake manifolds on my 2 '84's. should get another '84 soon and i can see if it matches one or the other.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Max The Chainsaw||12-29-2000||01:28 AM||||Sounds like you got one Indy with the recalls doen and one not. Parts of the recall included adding shields at the exhaust manifolds, changing the manifold, changing and relocating the dipstick. One way to tell which has had the recall is the dipstick. The recall dipstick was a "T" handle like a lawn mower starter cord handle. Hope this helps you.<BR>||||reg||1
