Z||000010||theogre||12-29-2000||10:59 PM||||There is a summary of the recall in my cave. The full text is available on ALLdata products and a few other places. The summary does have the part number for the recall kit. There may be other parts required depending on the car. 84 may have a second recall about the weak rods. I would see about leaning on the dealers to fix the one that hasn't been done. Do a search for recall posts in the forum. I posted the owner letter and it tells you what to do if the dealer and/or GM give you a raft of ______.||||reg||1
